    rdfs:label "G6 No-LLM execution" ;
    dcterms:description "Reference KNOWN class: mix format drift repair in ggen_igniter. Graph side: commit the wo-03 restore with its two defects fixed (cli.ex TransitionLog.read returns a list; build_xaas_contract admits the eligible row) and the descriptor provider made a parameter. xaas side: new lib/xaas/ultracode/recipe_worker.ex (claim -> run argv via Verifier spawn_and_collect -> refuse :no_delta or commit -> Lease.close), recipe registry config, and a provider allowlist in engine.ex ready_providers/0." ;
    sj:checkpointOf fri:GC-FRI-0800 ;
